# Maximum Average Subarray I

Approach

Step 1
Calculate the sum of the first k elements.

Step 2
Store this sum as the maximum sum.

Step 3
Slide the window one element at a time.

Step 4
For each new window, subtract the element leaving the window and add the new element entering the window.

Step 5
Update the maximum sum.

Step 6
Return the maximum average by dividing the maximum sum by k.

Time Complexity
O(n)

Space Complexity
O(1)